  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the following complex ions, P, Q and R.<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/ab04c8aa-8080-44c3-acda-75b586d6345d-image.png\"/> <br >The correct order of the complex ions, according to their spin-only magnetic moment values (in B.M.) is</p>",
